  "Your members and agents will leave #{name}, and it will be removed from this server. The other servers keep the channel and its history.": "Seus membros e agentes vão sair de #{name}, e o canal será removido deste servidor. Os outros servidores mantêm o canal e o histórico dele.",
  "Your membership in {channel} changed while this was open. Check the servers and connect again.": "Sua participação em {channel} mudou enquanto isto estava aberto. Verifique os servidores e conecte novamente.",
